  "title": "The Rebbetzin Chef&#39;s Persian Walnut Cookies",
  "description": "These delicately spiced, rose-scented Persian cookies are the perfect treat for Passover since they contain no flour. They are nutty, rich, and slightly chewy with a crunchy exterior.",
